                        "entry_id": "f81a2112-e298-345a-9b96-eb0f3de458ae",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A duel."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "obsolete"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2372a958-c23d-4599-a7bd-04c27e5d5f81",
                                "sense_id": "cbf36325-de14-389f-a326-b81c3da6b21d",
                                "text": "Come ſir Andrew, there's no remedie, the Gentleman will for his honors ſake haue one bowt with you: he cannot by the Duello avoide it: but hee has promiſed me, as he is a Gentleman and a Soldiour, he will not hurt you."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b601eba4-2152-4e1b-aa26-b285dfb4e386",
                                "sense_id": "cbf36325-de14-389f-a326-b81c3da6b21d",
                                "text": "the duello or monomachia"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "64381883-92b7-4ce7-b868-533242b6e0db",
                                "sense_id": "cbf36325-de14-389f-a326-b81c3da6b21d",
                                "text": "The native State of Patrick Henry Hanway was a moss-grown member of the republic and had been one of the original thirteen. It possessed with other impedimenta a moss-grown aristocracy that borrowed money, devoured canvasbacks, drank burgundy, wore spotless tow in summer, clung to the duello, and talked of days of greatness which had been before the war."
                            }
                        ]
